{"4249870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Oberion: Arena Arcana", "steam_appid": 4249870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >• <strong>A storyteller like no other</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the tale of Oberion through a narrator who uses a living board to bring each scene to life. Characters appear as animated miniatures, and the story unfolds right before your eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249870/extras/4e8ef6485f30772c86d3035e383120d1.avif?t=1777896044\" width=1560 height=874 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >• <strong>1-vs-1 tactical battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against AI opponents, other players in local or online matches, or take part in narrative battles within the story mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose up to 3 heroes, equip them, and create unique combinations to outplay your opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249870/extras/1b90f0640b2902f796e9962341603834.avif?t=1777896044\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >• <strong>Build your strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn coins and opals by winning battles. Use them to unlock new ability cards, gear pieces, and upgrades to refine your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249870/extras/d603aac14cf3cbe7e3796ee09ea1d0d3.avif?t=1777896044\" width=1560 height=874 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >• <strong>Story chapters and quick matches</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into narrative chapters with choices and battles woven into the plot, or jump straight into quick duels to test your builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249870/extras/a6810a6e99813d492a5c26dfb4c633f7.avif?t=1777896044\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >• <strong>A world told from the tabletop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the storyteller speaks, the board transforms, revealing locations, enemies, and events from Oberion as if springing to life in front of you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249870/extras/8bdb57c8580a158512afeff6f17911d8.avif?t=1777896044\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >• <strong>A storyteller like no other</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the tale of Oberion through a narrator who uses a living board to bring each scene to life. Characters appear as animated miniatures, and the story unfolds right before your eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249870/extras/4e8ef6485f30772c86d3035e383120d1.avif?t=1777896044\" width=1560 height=874 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >• <strong>1-vs-1 tactical battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against AI opponents, other players in local or online matches, or take part in narrative battles within the story mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose up to 3 heroes, equip them, and create unique combinations to outplay your opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249870/extras/1b90f0640b2902f796e9962341603834.avif?t=1777896044\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >• <strong>Build your strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn coins and opals by winning battles. Use them to unlock new ability cards, gear pieces, and upgrades to refine your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249870/extras/d603aac14cf3cbe7e3796ee09ea1d0d3.avif?t=1777896044\" width=1560 height=874 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >• <strong>Story chapters and quick matches</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into narrative chapters with choices and battles woven into the plot, or jump straight into quick duels to test your builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249870/extras/a6810a6e99813d492a5c26dfb4c633f7.avif?t=1777896044\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >• <strong>A world told from the tabletop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the storyteller speaks, the board transforms, revealing locations, enemies, and events from Oberion as if springing to life in front of you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249870/extras/8bdb57c8580a158512afeff6f17911d8.avif?t=1777896044\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Oberion: Arena Arcana blends narrative and tactical combat in a tabletop experience where every choice matters. Explore stories, engage in strategic PvE and PvP duels, and shape your own playstyle as you collect new heroes, abilities, and gear.", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249870/bbdbae4c30ef940c8dc2bf744a750e5f1f7ae00b/header.jpg?t=1777896044", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249